title: PlayerTurnedPowerInHideout
---
<<complete_objective DialogueCommands "ContactTrader003">>
Fulmen: Good work, friend. 
Fulmen: Take as long as you need in there to harvest your produce.
Fulmen: Here's your reward...
<<give_player_item DialogueCommands "ChokedCavernsElevatorKey" 1>>
-> A key? That's it?
    Fulmen: That key will give you access to the bottom-most level of my elevator right outside this building.
    Fulmen: You seem able to take care of yourself. Still, be careful, the Sheolites are not to be fooled with.
    -> Ok, thanks.
        <<jump End02>>
    -> What is it that frightens you?
        <<jump WhatFrightensFulmen>>

===

title: PlayerReturnedAfterRTGQuest
---
<<complete_objective DialogueCommands "TalkToCoreSalesman02">>
<<add_objective DialogueCommands "TakeElevatorToChokedCav">>
<<activate_objective DialogueCommands "TakeElevatorToChokedCav">>
Fulmen: Thank you, friend.
Fulmen: It'll be nice to have the old hideout back to full power.
Fulmen: You may use its facilities in your further activities in Ashpool Mine.
// Fulmen: I gotta charge you for the EquipBap and Bed Capsule. I think that's fair.
// Fulmen: This key should help you get into locked areas of Ashpool mine.
<<jump FulmenOfferingToBuy002>>
===

title: WhatFrightensFulmen
---
Fulmen: Sheolites aren't hostile to humans, exactly. But they don't understand us.
Fulmen: They... do things... to humans in their desire to talk to us. 
-> Ok I'll be careful.
    <<jump End02>>
-> They coerce people... to what? Alter themselves?
Fulmen: Not without permission. No, they have a sort of morality, they need consent.
Fulmen: But people I'd bet my one remaining fuckin' kidney woudn't consent, they... do?
Fulmen: After that, people tend to drop off the map and fuck knows to where. 
Fulmen: Just be careful.
===